      "raw_name": "DatabaseName",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "maxclients",
      "help_en": "The keyword used to query audit logs based on a specific command. By default, the audit logs of all executed commands are queried.\n\nYou can specify only one keyword",
      "help_zh": "根据指定的命令查询审计日志，默认查询所有执行过的命令。\n\n只能传入单个关键词",
